# Keep the Docker build context small and host-OS-agnostic. The .NET Dockerfiles
# rebuild from source (dotnet publish) and the admin SPA runs `pnpm install`, so
# none of these are needed in the context — shipping them only slows the build
# and risks leaking Windows-built artifacts into Linux images.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
# local deploy secrets must never enter an image layer
.env
